  "verse": "Therefore it is not the truth that you can nurture thoughts and feelings at a whim, without you having to give (make) an account for it, therefore you should consider everything if villainous thoughts and feelings proceed from you, such as in relation to … waging battles (waging war), giving false testimony … hatred, jealousy, revenge and retaliation…",
